          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo jotieko pokere kwoŋe, m'owey munyo omiyo go litho ma kiwacere, ŋecin pere jocamo tiende gi piny ro remo pa wod Yehoyada jacway ri Were i wi migam, to joneko go i wi kitanda pere. Ameno to Yowas tho, to joyiko go i tindi madwoŋ pa Daudi; makiweno i limbo pa kerin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jono ma jocamo tiendi go gi piny jobedo Zabad wod pa Simith Jaamon, kodi Yehozabad wod pa Simirith dhako ma Mowab. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
