            "sid": "2CH 24:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gima mako kwoŋ wote, kodi gigipiny m'owacere kwoŋ go, gi geto Ot pa Were kendo, ondiki i Kigana ma Kitawo pa kerin. Amaziya wode olunjo go paka kere.",
          "type": "text",
